# CVE-2026-8087, CVE-2026-8088 / OSGeo GDAL
# Vulnerabilities in GDAL through 3.13.0dev-4.
# Debian Bookworm ships libgdal 3.6.2 and no patched package is available in the
# Bookworm repos. The Python GDAL bindings must match the system library version
# exactly, so upgrading the Python package alone is not viable.
